+  "api_key": "<YOUR_ZHIPUAI_API_KEY>",
+  "model": "glm-4.7-flash",
+  "base_url": "https://open.bigmodel.cn/api/paas/v4"
+}
+```
+
+- Extend: OpenRouter/OpenAI-style payload compatibility can be added via the backend routing shim.
